          "thread": "Tether gold reserve depth",
          "why": "Tether's self-custody gold vault, $6.8B equity buffer solvency math, and abandoned HSBC hires raised concrete questions about whether XAU₮ backing is as robust as claimed."
        },
        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "Gold vs Bitcoin macro divergence",
          "why": "Gold outperforming Bitcoin by ~40% in a single year while ETF flows crossed in opposite directions made readers reassess the 'digital gold' narrative they'd accepted for years."
        },
        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "Tokenized gold yield strategies",
          "why": "Looping gold as USDC collateral for 22% APR and Bybit's 11-12% APR XAUT savings products showed readers a concrete new income stream they could act on."
        },
        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "Macro reserve rotation signal",
          "why": "China dumping Treasuries for record gold tonnage and the dollar falling on Powell ouster talk framed gold accumulation as a sovereign-level bet readers wanted to front-run."
        },
        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "RWA tokenization legitimacy",
          "why": "HSBC's bank-backed gold token, RAAC's Financial Times pickup, and Bhutan's sovereign gold token on Solana collectively tested whether institutional tokenized gold could escape the 'crypto gimmick' label."
        }
      ]
